{"slug":"Universal-Script-Module-X-UI-Library-73284","_id":"69362ed3d9a0d1f6b3a2933b","title":"Module X UI Library","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":"/images/sb/0-1765331598480.png","placeId":0},"features":"I tried to script a UI Library, First time, send comments on what to add next it right now has buttons and etc. I got inspired by rayfield to try to do one of these. Some feature might not work. Ive only tested this on Xeno so idk about other executors. The slider color must come before the slider or else the slider wont work.\n\nModule X SetUp Commands\n\nUI:SetLoadingText(LoadingText)\nUI:SetCreditsText(CreditsName)\nUI:CreateTab(TabName)\nUI:AddButton(TabName, Button name)\nUI:AddToggle(tabName, text, defaultState)\nUI:AddSlider(tabName, text, min, max, defaultValue)\nUI:SetSliderColor(color)\n\nHow to use\nUI:AnyCommand(\"\")\n\nSilderColors:\n    Red = Color3.fromRGB(255,0,0)\n    Blue = Color3.fromRGB(0,170,255)\n    Green = Color3.fromRGB(0,255,0)\n    Yellow = Color3.fromRGB(255,255,0)\n    Purple = Color3.fromRGB(179,2,255)","tags":[],"script":"local ModuleX = loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kyereal/ModuleX-UI-Library/refs/heads/main/Module%20X\"))()\nlocal UI = ModuleX.new()\n\n-- Loading Screen\nUI:SetLoadingText(\"Loading ModuleX...\")\nUI:SetCreditsText(\"kye._real\")\n\n-- Tabs\nUI:CreateTab(\"Universal\")\nUI:CreateTab(\"Random\")\n\n-- Buttons\nUI:AddButton(\"Universal\", \"Infinite Yield\", function()\n    loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EdgeIY/infiniteyield/master/source'))()\nend)\n\nUI:AddButton(\"Random\", \"Print Hey\", function()\n\tprint(\"Hey\")\nend)\n\n-- Toggles\nUI:AddToggle(\"Universal\", \"Auto Farm\", false, function(state)\n    if state then\n        print(\"Auto farm turned ON\") -- Toggled\n    else\n        print(\"Auto farm turned OFF\") -- Not Toggled\n    end\nend)\n\n-- Slider Color\nUI:SetSliderColor(\"Green\")\n\n-- Slider\nUI:AddSlider(\"Universal\", \"WalkSpeed\", 16, 200, 16, function(value)\n    game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character.Humanoid.WalkSpeed = value\nend)","owner":{"_id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c","username":"Kyereal","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6836989add375eb082a5a93c-1751374024015.jpg","status":"offline","id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":1424,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/0-1765331598480.png","likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2025-12-08T01:50:11.437Z","keyLink":"","editBy":{"_id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c","username":"Kyereal","status":"offline","id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c"},"discord":"https://discord.gg/52W5Fnwxs4","executes":26,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69362ed3d9a0d1f6b3a2933d","editBy":{"_id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c","username":"Kyereal","status":"offline","id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-12-08T01:50:11.441Z"},{"_id":"6938d28e06da572cb7e89f9d","editBy":{"_id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c","username":"Kyereal","status":"offline","id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c"},"message":"Added Toggle, Slider, SliderColor","createdAt":"2025-12-10T01:53:18.477Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69362f5fd9a0d1f6b3a29b42","commentBy":{"_id":"69362f1d53e4ff1d24eb1acf","username":"Thelon3lyguy123","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","lastActive":"2026-03-21T10:38:44.376Z","createdAt":"2025-12-08T01:51:25.150Z","status":"offline","id":"69362f1d53e4ff1d24eb1acf"},"text":"The start of something new W","edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-12-08T01:52:31.839Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69362f8e53e4ff1d24eb2140","commentBy":{"_id":"6836989add375eb082a5a93c","username":"Kyereal","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePi